@baseUrl = http://localhost:5106
@customerToken = MUSTERI_ACCESS_TOKEN
@adminToken = YONETICI_ACCESS_TOKEN
@orderId = SIPARIS_KIMLIGI
@idempotencyKey = HER_YENI_SIPARIS_ICIN_YENI_GUID

### Güncel sepet toplamını oku
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Sipariş ver; expectedTotal sepetten alınmalı
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expectedCurrency": "TRY",
  "expectedTotal": 499.90,
  "shippingAddress": {
    "recipientName": "Alici Adi",
    "phone": "+90 555 000 0000",
    "countryCode": "TR",
    "city": "Istanbul",
    "postalCode": "34000",
    "addressLine": "Ornek teslimat adresi"
  }
}

### Kendi siparişlerim
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Kendi sipariş detayım
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Siparişi iptal et
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Yönetici sipariş listesi
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orders?status=Pending&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Onayla
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Kargoya verildi olarak işaretle
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/ship
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Teslim edildi olarak işaretle
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/deliver
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
